 G","lizenz":"gemeinfrei (keine bekannten Rechte, Flickr Commons)","quelle":"commons-illustrationen","titel":"The fruit grower's handbook (microform) - a concise manual of directions for the selection and culture of the best hardy fruits in the garden or orchard (1851) (20181789378)"},{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b0/The_fruits_and_fruit_trees_of_America%3B_or%2C_the_culture%2C_propagation%2C_and_management%2C_in_the_garden_and_orchard%2C_of_fruit_trees_generally%3B_with_descriptions_of_all_the_finest_varieties_of_fruit%2C_native_%2814803347433%29.jpg/960px-thumbnail.jpg","seite":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_fruits_and_fruit_trees_of_America;_or,_the_culture,_propagation,_and_management,_in_the_garden_and_orchard,_of_fruit_trees_generally;_with_descriptions_of_all_the_finest_varieties_of_fruit,_native_(14803347433).jpg","art":"tafel","urheber":"Internet Archive Book Images","lizenz":"gemeinfrei (keine bekannten Rechte, Flickr Commons)","quelle":"commons-illustrationen","titel":"The fruits and fruit trees of America; or, the culture, propagation, and management, in the garden and orchard, of fruit trees generally; with descriptions of all the finest varieties of fruit, native (14803347433)"},{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/23/Yellow_Bellflower_-_Apples_of_New_York.jpg","seite":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Yellow_Bellflower_-_Apples_of_New_York.jpg","art":"tafel","urheber":"Beach, S. A. (Spencer Ambrose), 1860-1922 Booth, N. O. (Nathaniel Ogden), 1869-1919 Taylor, O. M. (Orrin Morehouse), 1865- New York (State). Dept. of Agricul...","lizenz":"gemeinfrei","quelle":"commons-illustrationen","titel":"Yellow Bellflower - Apples of New York"},{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0b/Ailly-le-Haut-Clocher%2C_Apple_festival_04_et_05-11-2023_%28apples%29_%2869%29_-_Belle_Fleur_jaune.jpg/960px-Ailly-le-Haut-Clocher%2C_Apple_festival_04_et_05-11-2023_%28apples%29_%2869%29